1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,520
好 我看看...
Okay, let's see...

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,740
帮我去拿一瓶特级初榨[处女]
Oh, could, you grab me an extra virgin...

3
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,080
我觉得有一个作为祭品就够了
I think one's enough for the sacrifice.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,200
橄榄油 菲尔
Olive oil, Phil.

5
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,460
笑一个 多逗啊
Come on. That's funny.

6
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:11,480
确实比你的三明治说唱好笑
Oh, it's funnier than your freestyle "Sandwich rap."

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,740
姑娘 你个疯子
Girl, you crazy.

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,740
跟我一起购物最有趣了
I'm mad fun to shop with.

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,700
徘徊在两个全麦面粉货架之间
Trapped in between two whole wheat slices.

10
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,160
唯五香熏牛肉和芝士与我相伴
Pastrami and swiss are my only vices.

11
00:00:21,636 --> 00:00:24,960
亲爱的 我的鞋 看着点 真是的
Sweetie, my shoe. Come on. Jesus. God.

12
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,220
你好
Hello.

13
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:26,100
你好
Hi.

14
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:27,460
路障
Oh, roadblock.

15
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:30,092
-哔哔哔 -不好意思
- Beep beep! - Pardon me.

16
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:32,740
你没事吧
Are you okay?

17
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:34,380
事实上 有事
Actually, not okay.

18
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:36,580
事儿大了
Not okay.

19
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:39,800
亲爱的 你是不是又从底下抽罐头了
Honey, did you pull from the bottom again?

20
00:00:42,616 --> 00:00:44,040
开胃菜之后
So after hors d'oeuvres,

21
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,960
我们把大家召集到客厅宣布这个消息
We'll bring everyone in here to share the news.

22
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,000
我们叫全家人明晚过来聚餐
We're having the family over tomorrow night

23
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,120
告诉大家我们打算再收养一个小孩
to tell them we're planning on adopting a new baby.

24
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,080
是的 而且我们都同意
Yes, and we both agreed

25
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:55,660
这次选择低调一点的方式宣布这个消息
to--to go a little more low-key with the announcement this time.

26
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:58,320
*来听听爱子的声音吧*
*Let's hear it for the boy ...*

27
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:02,840
我就问问清楚 这是低调吗
Okay, just to be clear, this is low-key?

28
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,020
就一条横幅
It's a banner

29
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:06,180
还有些轻音乐伴奏 米奇尔
And just some light musical accompaniment, Mitchell.

30
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,640
我不能再低调了
I don't have a lower key.

31
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,440
再说了 这是个欢乐的场合
Besides, this is a happy occasion.

32
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,100
对吧 莉莉
Am I right, lily?

33
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:11,840
你马上就有个弟弟了 是不是很开心
Aren't you excited to get a new baby brother?

34
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,800
不 我讨厌宝宝
No! I hate the baby!

35
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:18,040
我们遇到了一点小问题
We are having a slight issue

36
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,660
暂时尚未说服莉莉同意我们收养个儿子
getting Lily on board with the adoption.

37
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,240
"我讨厌宝宝"
"I hate the baby."

38
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,040
"不要新宝宝"
"No new baby."

39
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:23,718
"我想弄死那宝宝"
"I wanna make the baby dead."

40
00:01:23,718 --> 00:01:25,485
我们不是说好了不提这句的吗
I thought we weren't gonna share that one.

41
00:01:26,643 --> 00:01:29,040
我 我 我只是希望问题出在
I-I-I just hope that the problem is

42
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,820
她只是跟其他小孩相处太少了
she hasn't spent much time with any babies.

43
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,760
所以我们想了个好主意
So we thought it would be a great idea

44
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,040
如果有个孩子陪着她 她就会知道多有乐趣了
to show her how much fun it'll be to have one around.

45
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:37,220
他真可爱
oh, he is so cute!

46
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,580
是的 他从不哭闹
Yeah, and he never cries.

47
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:41,580
真的是没哭过 真是有点怪了
Literally never. It's actually a little weird.

48
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:42,660
不 这没什么
Oh, no, that's not weird.

49
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:44,880
我姐姐出生时全部牙齿已经长齐了
My sister was born with a full set of teeth.

50
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,280
乱说的 没那回事
Yeah, that never happened.

51
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,840
没 你不信 你该看看她的婴儿床
No? Really? You should've seen her crib.

52
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,060
就像是海狸睡过 被咬的乱七八糟
It looked like beavers lived there.

53
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:50,600
这是莉莉吗
Oh, is this Lily?

54
00:01:50,820 --> 00:01:53,400
对 是她 亲爱的 跟小家伙问好
oh, yes, it is. Hey, honey. Say hi to the baby.

55
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:54,980
这是我爸爸
My daddy!

56
00:01:56,247 --> 00:01:58,821
起码小孩儿不哭的问题是解决了
Okay, so that's one problem solved.

57
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,760
再见 再见
Bye! See you soon!

58
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,640
或者再也不见
Or never.

59
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:18,540
小卡 我有点被莉莉的举动吓坏了
Cam, I'm a little freaked out about what Lily did.

60
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:20,220
想太多了 她都没怎么碰到他
Oh, please. She barely touched him,

61
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:22,440
他就毫无缘由地大哭大闹
And he went from zero to big crybaby.

62
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:24,580
我们现在是要让这个家多个小成员
We're talking about bringing another child into this house.

63
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:27,620
莉莉对你的占有欲这么强怎么能行
How's that gonna work with Lily being so possessive of you?

64
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,300
我怎么听到指责的语气
Why am I hearing an accusatory tone?

65
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:32,780
拜托 你得承认你对他过于溺爱了
Oh, come on. You have to admit that you do coddle her.

66
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:35,200
我不会为爱我们的女儿而道歉
I will not apologize for loving our daughter.

67
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:36,460
我不是在批评你
I'm not criticizing.

68
00:02:37,580 --> 00:02:39,020
我不只是在批评你
I'm not only criticizing,

69
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:41,600
我的意思是我们要让莉莉更独立一些
But we did talk about giving Lily a little more independence.

70
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,600
没错 所以我们才把她送去幼儿园的啊
Yeah, which is why we put her in preschool.

71
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,420
对 但你却舍不得把她留在那儿
Yes, but you can't bear to leave her there.

72
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:46,440
你总是早早地去接她
You always pick her up early.

73
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,420
没有的事
That is ridiculous.

74
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:48,840
好 好
Okay. Okay.

75
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,140
莉莉 亲爱的
Lily, honey,

76
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,900
今天爸爸提前去幼儿园接你了吗
Did daddy pick you up early from preschool today?

77
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:54,100
没有
No.

78
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,160
"就此结案"
Case closed.

79
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,120
我根本没去上学
We didn't go.

80
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,020
"重新立案"
Case opened.

81
00:02:58,260 --> 00:02:59,460
我们去购物了
We went shopping.

82
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:00,160
好了好了
That's enough.

83
00:03:00,194 --> 00:03:03,032
我们买了父女帽
We bought matchy hats.

84
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:04,500
你得回房去了
you are going to your room.

85
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,960
你也跟进去干嘛
You're both going to her room.

86
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:09,560
我们常常黏在一起吗 是的
Do we spend a lot of time together? Yes.

87
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,260
我们父女感情甚密吗 当然
Do we have a special bond? Absolutely.

88
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:15,140
但说我过于溺爱她 远超过其他慈母仁父
But do I coddle her more than any other loving parent?

89
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,200
也许是吧
It's possible.

90
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:33,780
为了莉莉 我应该少一点溺爱
And for Lily's sake, I should probably work on that.

91
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,120
不 你给我冷静
No, you calm down!

92
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:39,260
有人指责我的曼尼偷东西我就这样说话
This is how I talk when somebody accuses my Manny of stealing.

93
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,740
-是谁 -是校长
- Who is that? - It's the principal.

94
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:43,185
他说曼尼偷了个什么女生的小吊坠
He's saying that Manny stole some girl's locket.

95
00:03:43,185 --> 00:03:46,072
你以为所有的哥伦比亚人都是罪犯
What, do you think that all colombians are criminals,

96
00:03:46,072 --> 00:03:47,480
因为哥伦比亚领带
because a colombian necktie

97
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:50,680
在全球都是暴力的标志吗
is a symbol of violence all over the world?

98
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:53,020
不不 我不是在恐吓你
No, no, I'm not threatening you.

99
00:03:53,460 --> 00:03:55,120
好的 我接受你的道歉
Okay. Apology accepted.

100
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,640
没有 我提到领带并没有什么特殊意思
No, I didn't mean anything about the necktie.

101
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,960
我只是 我只是随便举个例子说说
I just--I was trying to make a point.

102
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:10,600
你能不能笑得不那么大声
Could you "L." a little less "O.L."

103
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,340
你没看见我在干嘛吗
Don't you see what I'm trying to do here?

104
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,260
孤独地死去吗
Die alone?

105
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,120
姑娘们 吃饭了
Girls, dinner!

106
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,480
为什么卢克有自己的房间
You know, why does Luke get his own room,

107
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,920
我却要和你住一间 我再也受不了了
and I still have to share with you? I can't take it anymore.

108
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:21,920
我也是 即使只还有一年而已
Me either, even if it is just for one more year...

109
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,220
到时我就去读大学
when I leave for college.

110
00:04:23,258 --> 00:04:25,782
是确定只忍受一年 还是等你上大学的时候
It is one more year or when you leave for college?

111
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:27,540
那完全两码事 能不能上大学还不一定呢
Because those happen to be two different things.

112
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,700
我听到罐头堆中传来个小声音
So I hear this little voice coming from the cans

113
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:32,600
好像是在喊
And it's like...

114
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,040
"救救我 我被桃子淹没了"
"Help! I fell in the peaches!"

115
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,148
太是妈妈的风格了
that's mom!

116
00:04:37,395 --> 00:04:38,788
-太欢乐了 -绝对欢乐
- Hilarious! - So hilarious.

117
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:39,520
我想着 是克莱尔在喊吗
I'm like, "Claire?"

118
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,500
也许你该告诉他们
You might wanna tell them that it was you

119
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:43,020
是你把我推过去的
Who pushed me into the peaches in the first place.

120
00:04:43,020 --> 00:04:44,980
又来了 我当时几乎都没靠近你
This again? I wasn't even near you.

121
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:46,920
不 你就在我旁边 你把我撞到推车上
Yes, you were! You knocked me with the cart.

122
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:48,500
那完完全全是你的错
It was completely your fault.

123
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,940
让我们求同存异行吗
Well, let's just agree to disagree.

124
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:54,340
不行 我现在全是"异见"
No. I-I disagree to disagree.

125
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:55,840
负负得正了
Then you agree.

126
00:04:56,540 --> 00:04:58,380
不 不 没有 我是对的
No. No, I don't, because I'm right.

127
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,920
好吧 克莱尔 你是对的
Okay, claire. You're right.

128
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:04,040
一如往常
as usual.

129
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:06,320
-不 我就是对的 -一直都是
- No, I am right. - like always.

130
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:08,640
行了 如果我真错了 我会承认的
Stop it. When I am wrong, I admit it.

131
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,820
从未发生
which is never.

132
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,580
好吧 好吧
Fine. Fine.

133
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:18,220
你今晚有点不正常啊 曼尼 出什么事了吗
You're a little jumpy tonight, Manny. Anything wrong?

134
00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:20,880
没有 我刚想
No. Well, I'm just gonna--

135
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:21,420
孩子 坐下
Have a seat, kid.

136
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:24,140
也许是我的错觉
You know, maybe it's me,

137
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:27,280
但我感觉你今天有点古怪
But I thought you were kinda squirrelly tonight, you know,

138
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,360
在你妈妈接到校长电话之前
Before when your mom was on the phone with the principal.

139
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,180
我感觉你好像想说些什么
Almost like you wanted to say something...

140
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:34,300
但你却说不出口
but you just couldn't.

141
00:05:35,859 --> 00:05:37,644
现在有什么想说的吗 曼尼
anything you wanna say now, Manny?

142
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:41,837
没有 我没什么好说的
No. I have nothing to say.

143
00:05:41,837 --> 00:05:43,321
你确定
You sure about that?

144
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:45,540
好好想想
Think real hard.

145
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:50,500
我能喝杯水吗
Could I get a glass of water?

146
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:53,600
那个姑娘的小吊坠 是你拿的 对吧
That girl's locket-- you took it, didn't you?

147
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:58,000
-对不对 -是的 是我拿的
- Didn't you? - Yes.Yes, I took it.

148
00:05:58,100 --> 00:05:59,800
-我不是故意的 -我不想听你的借口
- I didn't mean to. - I don't wanna hear any excuses.

149
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:03,160
你去告诉你妈妈 然后把问题解决了
You're gonna tell your mom, and you're gonna set this right.

150
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,096
明白了吗
Do you understand?

151
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:06,160
好的 走吧
All right, get out of here.

152
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:09,400
还有一件事
Just one more thing.

153
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:12,720
你没有...
You're not, um...

154
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,920
你偷那个吊坠不是为了自己戴吧
You're not wearing that locket, are you?

155
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,180
没有 当然没有
No. Of course not.

156
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,840
那是女孩戴的 我干嘛要戴
It's a girl's. Why would I want to wear it?

157
00:06:19,191 --> 00:06:20,133
我就随口一问
It's no reason.

158
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:29,200
妈妈 快点 我不想迟到
Mom, hurry up! I don't want to be late for school.

159
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:31,580
你没告诉她是吧
You didn't tell her,did you?

160
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:35,400
为什么今早这么着急
What's the hurry this morning?

161
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:40,120
你们爷俩的表情是怎么回事
Okay, what's with the looks?

162
00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:42,500
就像在看默片一样
It's like a silent movie in here. Okay.

163
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:45,440
我跟在一个叫阿丽莎的姑娘后面 她要搬家了
I was walking behind this girl Alicia, who's moving away,

164
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:47,880
我好不容易鼓起勇气想要她的新地址
And I was working up the courage to get her new address

165
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,740
这样我就能给他写信了
So I can write her.

166
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:51,040
我比较擅长用文字表达自己
I express myself a lot better on paper than--

167
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,026
别太忽悠 孩子
Ticktock, kid.

168
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:55,660
好吧 她的吊坠掉了 然后我就捡起来了
Well, she dropped her locket, and I picked it up,

169
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:57,260
但是她一直在走 我
But she kept walking, and I...

170
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:00,420
你偷了吊坠
You stole the locket.

171
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,180
我还告诉校长
After I told the principal

172
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:03,980
你绝不会做出这样的事情
That you could have never done something like that,

173
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:06,494
我还用哥伦比亚领带威胁他
And I threaten him with the colombian necktie!

174
00:07:06,494 --> 00:07:08,000
为什么 曼尼
Manny, why?

175
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,140
别担心 他偷来不是因为自己想戴
Don't worry. It wasn't 'cause he wanted to wear it.

176
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:14,260
我只是想留个纪念
I thought I could keep it as something to remember her by.

177
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:16,246
但是后来你冲着维克斯先生大喊
But then you were yelling at Mr. Vickers,

178
00:07:16,246 --> 00:07:18,120
我就不敢告诉你了
And I-I was just too scared to tell you.

179
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,720
上车
Go to the car.

180
00:07:18,860 --> 00:07:19,880
-我真的很抱歉 -快去
- I'm really sorry. - Go.

181
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:25,060
他怎么会做出这样的事
Why would he do something like that?

182
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:27,220
他已经够怪异的了
It's bad enough that he's the boy

183
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:30,760
爱吹排笛 体型臃肿 没事儿就吟诗作对
with the pan flute and the puffy shirts and--and the poems.

184
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,360
现在还成了珠宝大盗
Now he's the jewelry thief.

185
00:07:32,620 --> 00:07:33,440
已经算上升个等级了
Might be an upgrade.

186
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:35,540
杰 这可不好笑
Ay, Jay, this is not funny.

187
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:37,120
这种污点终生都洗不掉啊
Those things stick to you.

188
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,480
我表妹洛萨·玛丽娜
My cousin Rosa Marina--

189
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:41,060
她14岁的时候 偷了东西 从那之后
When she was 14, she stole something, and after that,

190
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:44,100
所有人都把她当成是偷车贼
Everybody thinks of her as the girl who steals cars.

191
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,080
她偷了一辆车
She stole a car?

192
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:45,960
不止一辆
Cars.

193
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:49,140
但她一旦被贴上那样的标签 她还能干什么呢
But after she got that label, what else could she do?

194
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:51,060
听着 你不能控制孩子的想法
Listen, you can't control what kids think,

195
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,880
但是你能让他从这次的事件中得到教训
But you can make sure he learns from this.

196
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,420
你带他去校长办公室
You take him to the principal's office,

197
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:56,600
他承认错误 然后就不会再犯
He owns up to it, he never does it again.

198
00:07:57,820 --> 00:07:58,700
好吧 好吧
Okay. Okay.

199
00:07:59,260 --> 00:08:00,640
他是怎么想的
But what was he thinking?

200
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,640
这都不是真金的
This is not even real gold.

201
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:08,100
不可能 海莉 这是我的主意 我要这间
No way, Haley! It was my idea! I'm taking this room!

202
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:10,040
痴心妄想
Over my dead body!

203
00:08:10,260 --> 00:08:12,300
我要定了这间房
This is going to be my room,

204
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:15,880
你连想也别想
And there's nothing you can do about it!

205
00:08:17,380 --> 00:08:17,840
有点过吧
Seriously?

206
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:21,140
你们在吵什么
What are you guys fighting about?

207
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,740
我们都觉得
Okay, so we both think

208
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:24,820
这里做卧室再合适不过了
That this would make a totally awesome bedroom.

209
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,720
但只有一个人能拥有它
But only one of us can have it.

210
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,840
你不觉得应该是我吗
Don't you think it should be me?

211
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,740
是你的才怪 应该是我的 对吧 卢克
Oh, so not. It should be me. Right, Luke?

212
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:32,420
你们为什么想搬进阁楼来
why do you guys wanna move into the attic?

213
00:08:32,420 --> 00:08:33,980
你是说"顶层公寓"吗
Oh, you mean "The penthouse"?

214
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:38,000
隐私得到极大保护的独层公寓噢
With all the privacy of being on its very own floor?

215
00:08:39,734 --> 00:08:41,596
确实不错
It is kinda cool.

216
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,260
我不是白痴
I'm not an idiot.

217
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:45,820
我知道她们在打什么鬼主意
I knew what they were up to,

218
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:48,400
不过我也一直想挪个窝
but I've been wanting to move for a while.

219
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,100
有一队蚂蚁
There's a line of ants

220
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:52,080
正在向我衣橱里万圣节的糖袋子进军
going to a trick-or-treat bag in my closet,

221
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,780
我可不希望它们吃腻了糖
and I don't want to still be there

222
00:08:53,780 --> 00:08:54,980
就拿我当肉宰割
when they get tired of candy.

223
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:57,660
早上好 小公主
Good morning, princess.

224
00:08:57,980 --> 00:08:58,700
早上好 莉莉
Good morning, Lily.

225
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,260
真可爱 米奇尔
Very adorable, Mitchell,

226
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:02,255
但是 今天早上对我来说太艰难了
but I'm having kind of a rough morning,

227
00:09:02,994 --> 00:09:04,138
爹地 抱抱
Daddy, up.

228
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,960
对不起 莉莉 好日子到头了
I'm sorry, Lily, those days are over.

229
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,800
这是你的午饭
Now here's your lunch.

230
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:10,480
去把你的书包拿来 我们马上出发
Go get your bag. We will be leaving shortly.

231
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:13,940
小卡 你也不用对她这么冷冰冰啊
Cam, you don't have to ice her out completely.

232
00:09:14,060 --> 00:09:15,440
你以为我愿意这么做吗
Do you think I'm enjoying this?

233
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:18,880
但是我得让她在新东西来之前 摆脱对我的依赖
But I need her to detach from me before the new thing comes

234
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,400
不然的话 鬼知道她会对他怎么样
or who knows what she'll do to it.

235
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:22,220
你为什么把"宝宝"说成"东西"
Why are you saying "Thing" Instead of "Baby"?

236
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:24,120
干掉新宝宝
Kill the new baby.

237
00:09:24,827 --> 00:09:27,740
我知道这么做很难受
Oh. Um, look, I-I-I know this is hard,

238
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:29,800
我也很欣赏你的挽救措施
but I really appreciate what you're doing.

239
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,460
相信我
And believe me,

240
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:32,920
看着你受此煎熬 我也很难过
I take no pleasure in seeing you suffer like this.

241
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,620
我其实有点偷着乐
I take a little pleasure.

242
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:37,280
主要是因为 在为人父母这方面上
No, but there--there are very few parenting issues

243
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,360
我向来都表现比他糟糕
where I come out on top.

244
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:41,120
我跟家人有点疏远 我工作太忙了
You know, I'm distant. I work too much.

245
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,480
我给莉莉编的法式辫子像乱麻
My French braiding is "Sloppy."

246
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:46,720
终于 有些事不是我的错了
Finally, you know, something that isn't my fault.

247
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:48,160
准备好了
Ready.

248
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,460
你可不可以把她抱进车里
Could you please just go put her in her car seat

249
00:09:52,460 --> 00:09:53,620
我需要淡定一下
while I compose myself?

250
00:09:53,620 --> 00:09:54,580
好的 那个 小卡
All right, you know what, Cam?

251
00:09:54,580 --> 00:09:57,320
不如我上班时候顺便送她去幼儿园吧
Why don't I just take Lily to preschool on my way to work?

252
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,240
那敢情儿好
I think that would be best.

253
00:09:58,340 --> 00:10:00,640
出发之前让我来给你弄一份冰沙
Let me just whip up a smoothie for you before you go.

254
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:02,880
我要按那个按钮 爹地
I push the buttons, daddy.

255
00:10:04,420 --> 00:10:05,360
"好呀"
You certainly do.

256
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,540
你觉得校长会怎么处理我
What do you think the principal's going to do to me?

257
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:11,960
我是初犯
I am a first-time offender.

258
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,860
这下好了 我还迟到了 罪加一等
Oh, great. Now I'm tardy. Strike two.

259
00:10:14,860 --> 00:10:17,260
曼尼 态度积极点
Manny, think of this in a positive way,

260
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:19,500
-把它当成你的"哈哈"时刻 -什么意思
- Like it is your "Ha ha" moment. - What does that mean?

261
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:21,600
意思是 将来有一天你会一笑置之的
That means that one day, you're gonna laugh about it.

262
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:24,020
我当时就该把那该死的吊坠还给阿丽莎的
Ah, I should've just given that stupid necklace back to Alicia

263
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:25,740
那时候她就站在她的储物柜旁边
When she was standing right next to her locker.

264
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:28,140
这是我一生中最糟糕的一天
This is the worst day of my life,

265
00:10:28,140 --> 00:10:29,252
明天也是
till tomorrow... Oh.

266
00:10:29,252 --> 00:10:31,355
还有以后的每一天
And every day after that. Oh.

267
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,980
走吧 妈妈 让我们快点解决这件事
Come on, mom. Let's get this over with.

268
00:10:36,235 --> 00:10:37,700
-等一下 -怎么了
- Wait. - What?

269
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,200
你说哪个是她的储物柜 这个吗
Which one did you say that it was her locker? This one?

270
00:10:40,580 --> 00:10:42,600
是的 那个闻起来像玫瑰精油的味道
Mm-hmm. The one that smells like rose oil.

271
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,080
妈妈
Mom?

272
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:47,660
把好风
Keep the lookout.

273
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:54,420
现在 向我保证你再也不做这种事了
Now promise me that you will never, ever do anything dishonest again.

274
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,060
我保证
I promise.

275
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:57,266
很好 我养的儿子可不是珠宝大盗
Okay, because that's not the way I raised you.

276
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,420
对杰一定要守口如瓶 好吗
Don't tell Jay anything, okay?

277
00:10:59,812 --> 00:11:01,740
-早上好 莉莉 -好了 莉莉
- Hi, Lily. - All right, Lily.

278
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:03,340
玩的开心 甜心儿
Hi. Have fun, sweetheart.

279
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:04,180
再见
Bye.

280
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:06,300
她真可爱
She is so sweet.

281
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:09,220
谢谢 你真应该看看她昨天的样子
Oh, thanks. Well, you should've seen her yesterday.

282
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:11,460
她直接把一个宝宝从小卡膝上推下去了
Yeah, she pushed a baby off of Cam's lap.

283
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:13,240
我知道 我知道
I know. I know.

284
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:15,160
她对小卡的占有欲太强了
She is so possessive of him, but, you know,

285
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,900
小卡正在努力不那么宠着她了
Cam's really working on trying not to coddle her so much,

286
00:11:17,980 --> 00:11:18,320
所以
So...

287
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:20,840
我不觉得这和宠溺有关系
I'm not really sure it's about coddling.

288
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:22,820
更像是分享方面的问题
Sounds more like a sharing issue.

289
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:25,720
我们注意到莉莉不愿意与别人分享东西
You know, we've noticed Lily has a hard time with that.

290
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,880
-是吗 -我并不担心
- Really? - I wouldn't worry.

291
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,200
小孩子通常会从别的小孩身上学到
Kids usually pick that habit up from other kids,

292
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:32,120
也有些是从父母那里学到的
Except the ones that pick it up from their parents.

293
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,680
我们这有几个小孩子就是这样
We have a few of those in here.

294
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:37,400
当然 我不能告诉这些孩子的名字
Of course, I can't share those names with you...

295
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,840
除非我喝高了 酒后吐真言
until I get a glass of wine in my hand.

296
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,780
你真逗 伊莱恩小姐
Oh. Oh, Miss Elaine.

297
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:46,760
别人的确说过我可能有那么一丁点"分享障碍"
I have been told that I might have the teensiest issue with sharing.

298
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:49,960
但是莉莉真的是从我身上学到的吗
But is that something Lily would even pick up on?

299
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,140
我的鸡肉
My chicken.

300
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:56,220
我的枕头
My pillow.

301
00:11:58,640 --> 00:11:59,540
爹地的笔
Daddy's pen.

302
00:12:02,540 --> 00:12:03,680
好吧 有可能
Okay, it's possible.

303
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:06,920
为了莉莉 我应该改改了
And I suppose for Lily's sake, I-I should work on that...

304
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:10,700
偷偷地改 因为现在我们真的应该
privately. because right now we really need to

305
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:12,840
先搞定小卡的溺爱问题
get Cam's coddling problem under control.

306
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,980
怎么回事
What's going on?

307
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,420
搬到阁楼去睡
Moving into the attic.

308
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:21,080
给我一两天时间安定下来 我再请你上去坐坐
Give me a day or two to get settled, then I'll have you up.

309
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,220
你什么时候决定挪窝了
When did all this happen?

310
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:23,980
这要看你问谁了
Depends on who you ask.

311
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,060
我是已经觊觎了三周了
My plan's been in motion for three weeks.

312
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:29,440
亲爱的 这是个糟糕的主意 你会厌恶上面的
Honey, this is a terrible idea. You're gonna hate it up there.

313
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,180
妈妈 你别插手了
Mom, stay out of this.

314
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:33,800
现在我们都有自己的房间了 三赢
Yeah. We all have our own rooms now. Everybody wins.

315
00:12:33,853 --> 00:12:36,594
不要太爽 女孩儿们
Well, don't get too comfortable in there, girls.

316
00:12:36,620 --> 00:12:38,980
卢克 上面很冷 也很恐怖
Luke, it's cold, and it's scary up there.

317
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,960
你明天晚上就会回到自己房间的
You're gonna be back in your own room by tomorrow night.

318
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,120
我不明白 克莱尔 这里潜力无限
I don't know, Claire. It's got a lot of potential.

319
00:12:43,260 --> 00:12:46,060
这个比我们相遇时我住的那个好多了
This is a lot nicer than the attic I lived in when we met.

320
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:48,840
相信我 再舒适他也最多坚持一晚
One night, if that. Trust me on this.

321
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:51,940
噢对啊 因为你永远是对的
Oh, yes, because you're always right.

322
00:12:51,940 --> 00:12:53,580
孩儿们 我倒是想错一次
Sweetheart, I would love to be wrong.

323
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:55,700
但你们把错都犯完了 我想错都难啊
I just don't live with the right people for that.

324
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:58,540
算了吧 你妈是永不妥协的
Let it go, kids. She's not gonna budge.

325
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,600
-会唠叨我一晚上这事儿 -菲尔 的确是你推到我的
- Kept me up all night with the-- - Phil, you did push me!

326
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:02,940
你的说法跟我不一致
Your word against mine.

327
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:05,160
估计也很难搞清真相了 就像那些未解之谜
Guess it's one of those things we'll just never know,

328
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,940
好比泰坦尼克号沉没的真相
Like what really happened to the "Titanic."

329
00:13:07,460 --> 00:13:08,880
泰坦尼克是撞冰山了
It hit an iceberg.

330
00:13:09,119 --> 00:13:11,360
-或许吧 -必须的
- Maybe. - Mm, there's no maybe.

331
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,320
好吧 你是对的 克莱尔
Oh, you're right, Claire.

332
00:13:13,980 --> 00:13:14,420
又对了哦
Again.

333
00:13:14,420 --> 00:13:15,540
见怪不怪
Surprise, surprise.

334
00:13:15,540 --> 00:13:19,679
好吧 我们一会儿在米奇尔舅舅家见
Okay, I-I will see you over at uncle Mitchell's.

335
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:22,320
我得逃离这个批斗克莱尔大会
I'm gonna skip this meeting of the pile-on Claire club.

336
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,540
估计也是我把她推到那个"大会"上的
Guess I pushed her into that pile, too.

337
00:13:34,266 --> 00:13:35,769
我都等你们半辈子了
I spend half my life waiting on you.

338
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,600
你出门一次到底得换几次行头
How many times do you have to change your outfit?

339
00:13:37,632 --> 00:13:40,297
抱歉杰 选择太多也是个烦恼
Sorry, Jay. Too many choices is a prison.

340
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:42,580
趁他还想换条裤子之前赶紧走
Just drive before he rethinks the pants.

341
00:13:42,700 --> 00:13:44,300
-我裤子怎么了 -快 快
- What's wrong with my pants?! - Go. Go. Go.

342
00:13:47,420 --> 00:13:49,420
曼尼 今天跟校长谈得如何
So, Manny, how'd it go with the principal today?

343
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:53,380
不是很好 但儿子很勇敢 都过去了
It was terrible, but he was brave, and now it's over.

344
00:13:53,580 --> 00:13:54,760
-对吧 宝贝儿 -没错
- Right, Manny? - Mm-hmm.

345
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:57,737
-那个 -他们让你罚站还是停课
- So d-- - what'd they give you? Detention? Suspension?

346
00:13:57,780 --> 00:14:00,160
没有 因为是初犯只给了警告
No, just a warning because it was first offense.

347
00:14:00,182 --> 00:14:02,107
-今天工作如何啊 -挺好的
- So how was work? - Great.

348
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:03,020
只给了警告 是吧
Just a warning, huh?

349
00:14:03,340 --> 00:14:04,140
我妈说得没错
Like she said.

350
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:08,180
我问你工作 你就给我打岔
So I ask about work, and you change the subject.

351
00:14:08,380 --> 00:14:09,700
是不是瞒着我什么
Are you trying to hide something?

352
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:12,160
没有啊 我只想确保孩子没事 你没事吧
No, I just wanna make sure he's okay. You okay?

353
00:14:12,198 --> 00:14:14,702
我就是有点疑惑 你怎么汗如雨下的
'cause, I mean, it looks like you're sweatin' bullets back there, kid.

354
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:17,960
别逼他了 先是校长 又是你
Stop grilling him. First the principal, now you.

355
00:14:17,997 --> 00:14:20,721
这个可怜的孩子被折磨了一整天
This poor boy has been screamed at all day.

356
00:14:21,086 --> 00:14:23,940
-更别提 -闭嘴 我正掌控全局呢
- Well, not to mention-- - Quiet! I've got this.

357
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:31,680
-莉莉呢 -她在穿衣服
- Where is Lily? - Um, she's getting dressed.

358
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:32,680
自己穿吗
All by herself?

359
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:35,380
-小卡正在鼓励她更独立 -原来如此
- Cam is encouraging her to be more independent. - Oh.

360
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,680
小公主驾到
And there she is!

361
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:40,580
美极了吧
Doesn't she look beautiful?

362
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:44,060
她就像沾完了胶水
She looks like she was dipped in glue,

363
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:45,460
然后从跳蚤市场里拖出来的
and dragged through a flea market.

364
00:14:45,813 --> 00:14:46,873
-大家好 -来了啊
- Hey there! - Hi!

365
00:14:48,709 --> 00:14:50,181
-快进来 开胃菜准备好了 -大家好吗
- Guys. Come on in. There's hors d'oeuvres. - How's it going?

366
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:52,240
你们家有旧家具吗
Hey, do you guys have any old furniture?

367
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,560
我正要搬到阁楼住
I'm moving into the attic.

368
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:56,480
-住阁楼吗 -至少足够大
- The attic? - Hey, at least it's big.

369
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:59,500
外公说你以前住柜子里[同性恋隐瞒性取向]
Grandpa said you used to live in the closet.

370
00:14:59,500 --> 00:15:00,320
好吧 听我说
Okay. Well, you know what?

371
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:02,560
我们会给你找些家具用的
Yeah, we'll absolutely find you something for sure. Okay?

372
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:03,640
爸爸是我的
My daddy!

373
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:05,100
莉莉 别这样
Lily, no!

374
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:07,060
卢克 抱歉
I-I'm sorry, Luke.

375
00:15:07,060 --> 00:15:07,980
这事没完
This isn't over.

376
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,280
天呐 小米 她越来越放肆了
Oh, my god. Mitchell, she's getting worse.

377
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:14,100
我把她变成了一个放肆无礼的小怪物
I have turned her into a pushy, little, entitled monster,

378
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:16,440
她将来肯定会被逮捕 被戴上脚铐的
on her way to a rap sheet and a bracelet on her ankle.

379
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:18,860
不是吧 她已经戴上脚铐了
Oh, she has a bracelet on her ankle.

380
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:19,220
小卡
Cam.

381
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,000
小卡 冷静
Cam, Cam.

382
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,300
这或许不全是你的责任
This--this might not be entirely your fault.

383
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:24,800
还能是谁的
No, it is.

384
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:26,140
我跟莉莉的老师谈过了
I spoke with Lily's teacher.

385
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,900
老师觉得她可能有分享障碍
And she thinks that--that she may have a problem with sharing,

386
00:15:28,900 --> 00:15:31,160
她可能是从什么人身上学的...
Which she might have gotten from--

387
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:32,720
就是你啊 你不愿与人分享
You. You don't like to share.

388
00:15:32,900 --> 00:15:34,760
不 我有时那样做是想说明某个道理
No, I do it to make a point sometimes.

389
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,780
比如 你想吃鸡肉 就自己点啊
Like, if you want the chicken, then order the chicken.

390
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:38,284
等一下 你什么时候去跟莉莉老师谈的
Wait, when did you talk to Lily's teacher?

391
00:15:38,284 --> 00:15:40,300
今天 我送她上学时候
Uh, today, when I--when I dropped her off at school.

392
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:41,880
然后你居然让我自责了一整天
And you let me suffer all day?

393
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:44,540
我错了 但我们不能在大伙儿面前说这些吧
All right, look, we--we can't do this with everybody here.

394
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:46,680
-至少过了今晚再说 -好吧
- Can we please just get through the evening? - Yes,

395
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,160
但我们今晚不宣布领养孩子的事儿了
but we are not making the announcement tonight.

396
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,340
因为那本应是件高兴的事情
Because that is a joyful thing,

397
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:51,420
但我现在极为不高兴
And I am not feeling very joyful right now.

398
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:53,540
好吧 我分享到[感受到]你的怒火了
Well, I share your feeling.

399
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,920
告诉你吧 我看出你的把戏了
Just so you know, I'm on to you.

400
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,840
你根本没带曼尼去找校长
You never took Manny to the principal.

401
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:08,760
你继续装 但我了解曼尼
Okay, play it like that, but I know Manny.

402
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:11,580
他比你有良知
He has more of a conscience than you have.

403
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:14,240
他没法忍受良心受到谴责的
He's not gonna be able to live with this.

404
00:16:16,495 --> 00:16:18,871
杰 别小看良心的承受能力
You'd be surprised what people can live with, Jay.

405
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:25,940
莉莉小公主 你好吗
Hi, Miss Lily. How's my big girl doing?

406
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:26,660
很好
Good.

407
00:16:26,940 --> 00:16:29,020
告诉我 你今年几岁了
Can you tell me how old you are now?

408
00:16:31,808 --> 00:16:33,300
那表示四岁 这是三岁
That's 4. This is 3.

409
00:16:33,300 --> 00:16:34,840
来 再说一次 你几岁了
Okay, show me again. How old are you?

410
00:16:35,009 --> 00:16:37,212
-三岁 -不对 那是四岁
- 3. - No! That many is 4.

411
00:16:37,212 --> 00:16:40,040
这才是三岁
This many is 3.

412
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:42,220
别争了莉莉 你说不过她的
Don't argue, Lily. You'll never win.

413
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,420
是吗 菲尔
Really, Phil?

414
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:47,320
好吧 我本来打算回家再放这个的
Okay, I-I was gonna wait until we got home for this,

415
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:50,040
但现在我决定让大家分享这个开心一刻
But now I think it's something everyone's gonna enjoy.

416
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:52,040
大伙儿都到客厅来
Guys, everybody, come on down to the TV room.

417
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:54,220
给你们看个精彩的真人秀
I've got something really special to share.

418
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,240
每人来点喝的吗
Okay, how's everybody on drinks?

419
00:16:56,420 --> 00:16:59,220
如果又像上次艾丽克斯毕业典礼那样 给我一整瓶吧
If this is Alex's graduation again, just leave me the bottle.

420
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:01,260
我不要了 小卡
I'm good, Cam.

421
00:17:01,260 --> 00:17:02,140
大家就坐了
Okay, everybody.

422
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:04,220
好戏开始
Showtime.

423
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,600
我靠 居然是那天在超市的录像
Oh, my gosh. It's us at the market.

424
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:09,940
-你怎么搞到的 -没错 超市监控录像
- How did you-- - Yeah, it's security camera footage.

425
00:17:09,940 --> 00:17:11,280
我不明白 我们要看什么
I don't understand. What are we watching?

426
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:12,950
我可以跟你说 绝对不是《教父》
It ain't "The godfather," I can tell you that much.

427
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,680
好的 听着 我昨天在商场里跌倒了
Okay, look, I fell yesterday at the market,

428
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:16,260
菲尔跟我在责任问题上
And Phil and I have been having a little disagreement

429
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,880
持不同意见 看着 就是这儿
as to what happened. Just watch. Okay, right here.

430
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:20,600
我停下来去整理鞋子 然后菲尔
I stop to fix my shoe, and then Phil--

431
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:21,740
在那里 好的
right there. Okay.

432
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:24,380
他给一位漂亮的女士让路
He makes way for this very attractive woman,

433
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:27,300
在他的叙述中 他把这段艳遇省略了
whom he conveniently leaves out of his retelling of the story.

434
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:29,840
就在这时 菲尔往后退了一步
Now right here, Phil backs up,

435
00:17:29,933 --> 00:17:31,200
屁股撞到了购物车
pushes his butt into the cart,

436
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,620
让我撞到了那一堆罐头上
pushes me into the cans!

437
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:33,660
看到了没
Do you see that?! Oh!

438
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:36,380
都是他的错 就跟我说的一样
It's all his fault, just like I said!

439
00:17:36,420 --> 00:17:38,840
我才是对的 去死吧
I was right! Suck it!

440
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:41,840
-你什么时候拿到的 -我的天呐
- When did you get this-- - Oh, my god.

441
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,940
这就是为什么你想单独过来
That's why you wanted to come separately.

442
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,020
你搞得那么麻烦就为了证明你是对的
You went to all that trouble just to prove you were right?

443
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:48,420
其实也没那么麻烦
It really wasn't that much trouble.

444
00:17:48,700 --> 00:17:51,260
我只是到商场 找到你的朋友乔丹
I just went to the store, found your friend Jordan the bag boy,

445
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,260
他帮我找到了经理
who got me the manager.

446
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:55,060
他给了我远程安保室的地址
He gave me the address of the off-site security office.

447
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:57,260
我填了几张表 萨利把它传真到公司
I filled out some paperwork. Sally faxed it to corporate.

448
00:17:57,500 --> 00:18:00,280
三分钟后我买了张DVD 刻了一张碟
Three minutes later, I'm buying pack of dvds and burning a copy.

449
00:18:00,660 --> 00:18:01,060
小事一桩
Cake.

450
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:03,580
疯狂到病态啊
It's like a sickness.

451
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:06,220
干嘛 谁叫你们都不信我
What? None of you believed me,

452
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,080
我只好自证清白咯
so I got proof.

453
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,760
你们现在都去死吧
You should all be sucking it right now.

454
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:11,120
你能别再说"去死"好吗 克莱尔
Hey, please stop with the "Sucking it," Claire.

455
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:11,980
孩子都在呢
The children!

456
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:13,720
没错 孩子们非常容易受影响
Yes, children are very impressionable.

457
00:18:13,740 --> 00:18:14,840
你永远不知道他们会捡什么学
You'll never know what they'll pick up.

458
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:17,560
小卡 我很抱歉把责任都归咎到你身上
Okay, cam, I'm sorry that I blamed it on you, okay?

459
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:19,380
但是我们的一言一行都得注意
But we both need to look at our actions.

460
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:21,640
如果我们想再领养一个孩子的话
I mean, if we're thinking about adopting another baby,

461
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:23,140
我们需要...
then we need to--

462
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:26,021
-你们 -你们要再领养一个
- You guys... - You're adopting another kid?

463
00:18:26,021 --> 00:18:27,805
-不不不 -你们 等等 恭喜
- No! No, no! - You're--wait! Congratulations!

464
00:18:27,805 --> 00:18:29,541
我们还在考虑 还没...
We're thinking about it. It's not...

465
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:34,460
到底发生什么事了
What the hell's happening here?

466
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:36,198
是《浑身是劲》的插曲吗
Is that from "Footloose"?

467
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:38,060
不是吧 米奇尔
Really, Mitchell?

468
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,880
你都不肯和我分享一起宣布消息
You couldn't even share telling your family!

469
00:18:40,404 --> 00:18:41,420
行 行
Fine. Fine.

470
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:44,500
但你怎么这么郁闷呢 这是个好消息
But why are you upset? This is such good news.

471
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:45,831
不 我们只是有点担心
No, we're a little on edge

472
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:47,760
因为莉莉最近表现出
because lily has been acting out

473
00:18:47,793 --> 00:18:48,975
她不想要兄弟姐妹
like she doesn't want a sibling, and--

474
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,800
没错 因为米奇尔把她教的不懂分享
Yeah, because Mitchell taught her to hate sharing.

475
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:54,700
或是因为小卡片刻不离地把她"戴"在身边
And/or because cam wears her like a fanny pack.

476
00:18:54,749 --> 00:18:55,755
不要再互相责怪了
Oh, stop blaming each other.

477
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:56,940
没有孩子喜欢有兄弟姐妹
No kid wants a sibling.

478
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,700
克莱尔小时候就非常不待见你
I mean, Claire hated you so much

479
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,180
你两岁时她把你塞进了烘干机里
She stuck you in a dryer when you were 2.

480
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:01,920
你把我塞进烘干机里
You put me in the dryer?

481
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:04,198
没错 但不是因为我不喜欢你
I did, but it wasn't 'cause I hated you.

482
00:19:04,198 --> 00:19:05,640
我朋友玛琪说
My friend Marci said

483
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,200
烘干机里面有孩子是无法起动的
That it wouldn't run with a kid inside it,

484
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:09,580
但我知道它会 事实证明我是对的
and I knew it would. I was right.

485
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:10,340
主啊
Good governor.

486
00:19:11,126 --> 00:19:13,394
你五岁的时候就这样了
It's been going on since you were 5?

487
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:16,480
-天啊 真是扭曲病态啊 -你才知道
- Oh, my god. It is a sickness. -Yeah.

488
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:20,420
是什么让我那么小就这么扭曲了
What would make me have that need at such a young age?

489
00:19:20,420 --> 00:19:22,620
我在那烘干机里呆了多久 因为我
How long was I in that dryer? Because I--

490
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,260
我是因此才那么害怕翻跟头吗
Is this why I'm afraid of tumbling?

491
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:26,700
我不得不退出体操队 克莱尔
I had to quit gymnastics, Claire!

492
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:28,700
一个没有翻跟斗的童年
A childhood without tumbling?

493
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:32,300
你知道这些 却只是旁观不语
You knew this and just stood by and did nothing?!

494
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,420
好了好了 木已成舟
Okay, okay. What's done is done!

495
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,520
你们能做的就是从中吸取教训
All you can do is learn from your mistakes.

496
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:38,000
本着这种精神
And in that spirit,

497
00:19:38,220 --> 00:19:41,440
我要敬曼尼一杯
I would like to propose a toast... to Manny.

498
00:19:41,940 --> 00:19:44,300
这周他做了一件本不该做的事
This week, he did something he wasn't supposed to do,

499
00:19:44,300 --> 00:19:46,625
-就跟我们一样 -就跟我们一样
- like we all do-- - Like we all do!

500
00:19:46,625 --> 00:19:48,757
-敬曼尼 -等等
- Salud to Manny! - Uh, not yet.

501
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,640
但是曼尼男子汉似的站出来
But Manny stood up like a man.

502
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:53,380
他承认了错误 并且接受了惩罚
He admitted he was wrong and he took his licks,

503
00:19:53,380 --> 00:19:54,680
我为他感到自豪
and I'm damn proud of him.

504
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,880
现在干杯
Ah, now we clink!

505
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,580
不 只有我说干杯时才干杯
No, we clink when I say we clink.

506
00:19:58,420 --> 00:20:01,580
曼尼犯了错 但是他却没有逃避
So Manny made a mistake, but he didn't take the easy way out.

507
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:03,980
他很勇敢 正直善良
He's got guts, he's got integrity.

508
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,640
就我所知 他是最棒的小...
As far as I'm concerned, he's the best little b--

509
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:09,120
够了 停停 你说的我都没做
Okay, stop! Stop! I didn't do any of that.

510
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:11,480
老妈撬开了柜子把吊坠扔回去了
Mom broke into the locker and threw the necklace inside,

511
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,800
然后我们像胆小鬼一样溜走了
and then we ran away like cowards.

512
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:14,900
-对不起 杰 对不起 -我就知道
- I'm sorry, jay! I'm sorry! - I knew it!

513
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:16,460
我是对的 我是对的
I was right! I was right!

514
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:27,160
谁
Who is it?

515
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:30,420
亲爱的 是我 你还好吗
Hi, honey. It's just me. Are you okay?

516
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:31,680
我很好
Yeah. I'm great.

517
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,460
喜欢你的新居吗
So, how you liking your new digs?

518
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:36,140
我知道你说这上面会很冷
I know you told me that I'd be cold...

519
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:37,080
我会被吓坏
and scared...

520
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:39,600
-但你错了 -是的 我看得出来
- But I'm not. - No, I can see that.

521
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:41,405
是我错了
I was--I was wrong.

522
00:20:41,405 --> 00:20:42,640
-是你错了 -是的
- You were. - Yeah.

523
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:44,520
那么接下来你肯定非常不喜欢了 亲爱的
Well, you're gonna hate this then, honey,

524
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:47,400
我需要你下去 回你原来的房间去
but I'm gonna need you to go back down and sleep in your old room.

525
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:49,920
我怕你这么小就拥有
I just--I'm worried if you get something so cool

526
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,240
如此奇妙的体验
this early in your life,

527
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:53,460
你以后就没有什么可以期待的了
You're not gonna have anything to look forward to later.

528
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:55,720
我现在就得下去吗
I-I have to go now?

529
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,520
如果你想的话你也可以在这里过夜
You can spend the night tonight here if you want.

530
00:20:57,720 --> 00:21:00,760
不了 如果这对你那么重要
Oh! No, if it's so important to you,

531
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:01,720
我现在就下去
I'll go now.

532
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:05,200
你也应该下去
You should come, too.

533
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:07,280
有什么东西在那里
Something sleeps over there.

534
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,680
等等我 等等我
Wait for me. Wait. Wait for me! Wait for me.
